# Spec-driven development

- Features are **F-000, F-001, …** in `docs/Docs_001/feature_roadmap_001.md`.
- Each feature has a contract in `specs/specs_001/F-0xx_<name>.md`.
- **Do not implement** until the user approves the spec for that feature.
- **Do not edit** `docs/Docs_001/feature_roadmap_001.md` or `docs/Docs_001/architecture_001.md` unless the user explicitly asks.
- When implementing F-0xx: read the spec, set `.cursor/feature-scope.json`, run verify-backend after changes.

Use skill `/implement-f-feature` when starting feature implementation.
